{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":496,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1891838,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282627,"Name":"STBMrsV","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1428181971,"LastPoster":{"Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1895285,"PostDate":1430760591,"PostContent":"@STBMrsV There are so many great photographers in Punta Cana. The most popular being HDC, Katya a...","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394136776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.14.82.89","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fdf0f542754bcb819bf73d18886ccc67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am newly engaged and looking to have a destination wedding in Punta Cana February of 2016. I am starting to feel the stress because I still can&#039;t decide on a resort, and it has put other planning on hold. I can&#039;t decide between the Dreams Palm Beach resort and the Majestic Elegance resort. I have read the recent reviews for the Dreams Palm Beach, but the most recent reviews for the Majestic Elegance are from 2013. Does anyone have any input on either or these resorts? Even feedback on wedding coordinators for the resorts and photographers would be helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891838,"PostDate":1428181971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am newly engaged and looking to have a destination wedding in Punta Cana February of 2016. I am starting to feel the stress because I still can't decide on a resort, and it has put other planning on hold. I can't decide between the Dreams Palm Beach resort and the Majestic Elegance resort. I have read the recent reviews for the Dreams Palm Beach, but the most recent reviews for the Majestic Elegance are from 2013. Does anyone have any input on either or these resorts? Even feedback on wedding coordinators for the resorts and photographers would be helpful!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"oxodree44oxo@msn.com","IpAddress":"69.14.82.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428180895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"STBMrsV","Id":282627,"Name":"STBMrsV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.94.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2210ca272433eb881dc313f8722467be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got married at Dreams Palm Beach a month ago and it was fantastic! I had no issues planning the wedding and everything went very well. I can&#039;t say enough good things about dreams!&amp;nbsp;All of our guests loved the resort and would go back again. The WC at Dreams are very good at what they do. I&#039;m not sure the difference in price points, but Dreams is definitely a great resort!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891916,"PostDate":1428281516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got married at Dreams Palm Beach a month ago and it was fantastic! I had no issues planning the wedding and everything went very well. I can't say enough good things about dreams!\u00a0All of our guests loved the resort and would go back again. The WC at Dreams are very good at what they do. I'm not sure the difference in price points, but Dreams is definitely a great resort!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390776531,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.190.53.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2d7050bd3a2d2deb9ff67ce6956a77a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"STBMrsV\" post=\"1891838\" timestamp=\"1428178371\"]\nHello,\n\nI am newly engaged and looking to have a destination wedding in Punta Cana February of 2016. I am starting to feel the stress because I still can&#039;t decide on a resort, and it has put other planning on hold. I can&#039;t decide between the Dreams Palm Beach resort and the Majestic Elegance resort. I have read the recent reviews for the Dreams Palm Beach, but the most recent reviews for the Majestic Elegance are from 2013. Does anyone have any input on either or these resorts? Even feedback on wedding coordinators for the resorts and photographers would be helpful!\n\nThanks! :)[\/quote]Hi,\n\nI got married in Punta Cana 2 years ago.  We stayed at the Majestic Elegance but actually got married at the Jellyfish.  I would do it all over again in a heartbeat.  Whereas the Majestic is an amazingly beautiful resort, the food was not that great.  Again, that was two years ago so things could have changed.  Unfortunately, I can&#039;t comment on the Dreams.","Attachments":[],"Id":1894998,"PostDate":1430445849,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>STBMrsV, on 04 April 2015 - 01:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am newly engaged and looking to have a destination wedding in Punta Cana February of 2016. I am starting to feel the stress because I still can't decide on a resort, and it has put other planning on hold. I can't decide between the Dreams Palm Beach resort and the Majestic Elegance resort. I have read the recent reviews for the Dreams Palm Beach, but the most recent reviews for the Majestic Elegance are from 2013. Does anyone have any input on either or these resorts? Even feedback on wedding coordinators for the resorts and photographers would be helpful!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got married in Punta Cana 2 years ago.\u00a0 We stayed at the Majestic Elegance but actually got married at the Jellyfish.\u00a0 I would do it all over again in a heartbeat.\u00a0 Whereas the Majestic is an amazingly beautiful resort, the food was not that great.\u00a0 Again, that was two years ago so things could have changed.\u00a0 Unfortunately, I can't comment on the Dreams.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tashenag@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.190.53.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329792323,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251694.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":128,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tashena Gasaway","Id":251694,"Name":"Tashena Gasaway","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.4.194.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de2e9a48371b2e118c35c9fdc93f6b08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We decided on Dreams Palm beach and the wedding is scheduled for January 2016! I&#039;m super excited to start planning! Do you have any tips\/suggestions? I&#039;m looking at reviews for a photographer right now, did you use an outside vendor?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895266,"PostDate":1430750416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We decided on Dreams Palm beach and the wedding is scheduled for January 2016! I'm super excited to start planning! Do you have any tips\/suggestions? I'm looking at reviews for a photographer right now, did you use an outside vendor?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"oxodree44oxo@msn.com","IpAddress":"69.14.82.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428180895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"STBMrsV","Id":282627,"Name":"STBMrsV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63a04df6941be7b363a5ea602ea913bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"STBMrsV\"] There are so many great photographers in Punta Cana. The most popular being HDC, Katya and Asia. It just depends on what style of photos you&#039;re going for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895285,"PostDate":1430760591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282627\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282627-stbmrsv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">STBMrsV<\/span><\/a> There are so many great photographers in Punta Cana. The most popular being HDC, Katya and Asia. It just depends on what style of photos you're going for.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394136776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79021","Title":"Dreams Palm Beach Punta Cana Vs. Majestic Elegance Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1430760591},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
