                body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! And most definitely there are a lot of brides here having a weekend DW. In fact 2 ladies just got married last Saturday in Mexico. it depends on whether they're having just a weekend event, or turning it into a whole week's vacation.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fde1f64d4d3cc20e29756568302230b9","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;We have a great new promotion for BDW Brides! &amp;nbsp;Book your wedding with Wright Travel Agency and fly FREE! &amp;nbsp;See below for more information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Book 15 rooms or more at selected properties and receive free round trip coach air tickets.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(199,135,115);\"&gt;Book 3\/16\/2015-5\/31\/2015 for travel through 12\/31\/2016&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;For more information:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:info@wrighttravelagency.com\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152);\"&gt;info@wrighttravelagency.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);\"&gt;Or&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;fill out our contact form:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/bride-groom-fly-free?LP=FlyFree&amp;amp;keyword=BDWThread\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(98,158,152);