> User kathryn78 (272662)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76fdf8ec17627799c8867e1dca90094c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jea10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Ladies,\n How is everyone&#039;s plans going with the WC at Dreams? I am very stressed with the response time from them. \n \n I am planning on visiting the resort in exactly 30 days. I wanted to visit the resort before I make my final decision in booking my wedding with them. From the way things are going it looks like I am not going to! I sent several emails asking to set up an appointment or time when we can meet during my stay next month. I have yet to receive a response. I know I have time but all the past experiences I have had with them is not positive. It is very difficult to receive a response. I am almost to the point of changing the resort for my wedding. \n \n Does anyone have any suggestions of another resort?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n I&#039;m getting married at the Paradisus Palma Real. All the paradisus only do one wedding per day and the response time for my emails has been 1 to 3 days, never more than that. I was originally booked with dreams but got really nervous when the WC wasnt getting back to me. Maybe once you meet with them, they&#039;ll be better. I heard they sometimes get 300 emails a day and do multiple weddings a day, so they must be extremely busy.","Attachments":[],"Id":440017,"PostDate":1220578253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jea10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Ladies,<br \/> How is everyone's plans going with the WC at Dreams? I am very stressed with the response time from them. <br \/> <br \/> I am planning on visiting the resort in exactly 30 days. I wanted to visit the resort before I make my final decision in booking my wedding with them. From the way things are going it looks like I am not going to! I sent several emails asking to set up an appointment or time when we can meet during my stay next month. I have yet to receive a response. I know I have time but all the past experiences I have had with them is not positive. It is very difficult to receive a response. I am almost to the point of changing the resort for my wedding. <br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have any suggestions of another resort?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I'm getting married at the Paradisus Palma Real. All the paradisus only do one wedding per day and the response time for my emails has been 1 to 3 days, never more than that. I was originally booked with dreams but got really nervous when the WC wasnt getting back to me. Maybe once you meet with them, they'll be better. I heard they sometimes get 300 emails a day and do multiple weddings a day, so they must be extremely busy.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>***Married November 6, 2008***Gavin Born February 28th, 2010***<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/32855\/danielle-s-paradisus-palma-real-wedding-review-long\">Paradisus Palma Real Wedding Review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www2.snapfish.com\/snapfish\/thumbnailshare\/AlbumID=260961377\/a=55019552_55019552\/otsc=SHR\/otsi=SALBlink\/COBRAND_NAME=snapfish\/\">Our Professional Wedding Pictures on Snapfish<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dnllmz@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.168.140.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1194561900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207914.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DanielleNDerek","Id":207914,"Name":"DanielleNDerek","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c063c9b4cb88818e9c853922a80bdd67","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jea10&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi Ladies,\n How is everyone&#039;s plans going with the WC at Dreams? I am very stressed with the response time from them. \n \n I am planning on visiting the resort in exactly 30 days. I wanted to visit the resort before I make my final decision in booking my wedding with them. From the way things are going it looks like I am not going to! I sent several emails asking to set up an appointment or time when we can meet during my stay next month. I have yet to receive a response. I know I have time but all the past experiences I have had with them is not positive. It is very difficult to receive a response. I am almost to the point of changing the resort for my wedding. \n \n Does anyone have any suggestions of another resort?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Jea10, I would recommend going onto the Dreams website and joining there forum. there is a woman, baltobabe who seems to get things done for people! So if you really want to check out dreams I would go there and have her help you out! \n \n Also, I know it is nerve wrecking with the response time or in your case no response but everything I have read on here or on the dreams forum is that it all turns out perfect!","Attachments":[],"Id":441223,"PostDate":1220663228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jea10<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Ladies,<br \/> How is everyone's plans going with the WC at Dreams? I am very stressed with the response time from them. <br \/> <br \/> I am planning on visiting the resort in exactly 30 days. I wanted to visit the resort before I make my final decision in booking my wedding with them. From the way things are going it looks like I am not going to! I sent several emails asking to set up an appointment or time when we can meet during my stay next month. I have yet to receive a response. I know I have time but all the past experiences I have had with them is not positive. It is very difficult to receive a response. I am almost to the point of changing the resort for my wedding. <br \/> <br \/> Does anyone have any suggestions of another resort?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Jea10, I would recommend going onto the Dreams website and joining there forum. there is a woman, baltobabe who seems to get things done for people! So if you really want to check out dreams I would go there and have her help you out! <br \/> <br \/> Also, I know it is nerve wrecking with the response time or in your case no response but everything I have read on here or on the dreams forum is that it all turns out perfect!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meagryan1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1201820293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208426.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"happygilmore","Id":208426,"Name":"happygilmore","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfe0f8bfae4d823374d965d7dded41ec","RawContent":"Thanks everyone! I have some decisions to make.","Attachments":[],"Id":441753,"PostDate":1220722554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks everyone! I have some decisions to make.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"figueje@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1208317972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209106.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jea10","Id":209106,"Name":"Jea10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"789fa8169325a29bd4c96d6d7f87ef37","RawContent":"Thanks, Teryane. Can you send me the information. My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:figueje@aol.com\"&gt;figueje@aol.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":441754,"PostDate":1220722692,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks, Teryane. Can you send me the information. My email is <a href='mailto:figueje@aol.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>figueje@aol.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"figueje@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1208317972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209106.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jea10","Id":209106,"Name":"Jea10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"345fb3fc3267b626d497240c026eeb0d","RawContent":"i am also thinking of dreams, my ta has done a few weddings there and her cousin is getting married there also. she has said great things about the resort. i&#039;m going to visit in jan will post my opinion.","Attachments":[],"Id":468041,"PostDate":1222843032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i am also thinking of dreams, my ta has done a few weddings there and her cousin is getting married there also. she has said great things about the resort. i'm going to visit in jan will post my opinion.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mimirdh1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221295713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211702.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rdhbride","Id":211702,"Name":"rdhbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f59d0d6ebc790a5f7d1eb8664aae9a2c","RawContent":"Hi, Does anyone have any reviews or pics of their brand new resort Dreams Palm Beach? My TA recommened this resort and is scheduled to open Dec 2008. I was wondering if there are other spots to have the wedding instead of the gazebo. Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":474100,"PostDate":1223368700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, Does anyone have any reviews or pics of their brand new resort Dreams Palm Beach? My TA recommened this resort and is scheduled to open Dec 2008. I was wondering if there are other spots to have the wedding instead of the gazebo. Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sweetluvin675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1206935870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208968.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsSunshine","Id":208968,"Name":"MsSunshine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1f0c222a0d00ea9999931c732f80ed8","RawContent":"I believe Dreams can only have 2 weddings per day as a rule. \n \n I can&#039;t wait to get married there! It is only one week and one month away for me. I will definitely post pics when I get back. As well as a lengthy review. \n \n :)","Attachments":[],"Id":481817,"PostDate":1224200168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I believe Dreams can only have 2 weddings per day as a rule. <br \/> <br \/> I can't wait to get married there! It is only one week and one month away for me. I will definitely post pics when I get back. As well as a lengthy review. <br \/> <br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelley.brule@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212544320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209743.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chika","Id":209743,"Name":"chika","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dae21a61b5caeb2e1200d3e154b827b8","RawContent":"Quick Question - Has anyone thrown a welcome dinner the first night they arrived? We fly in around 1230 on a Sunday afternoon, and I was thinking it would be nice for all of us (approx 35 ppl) to have dinner together the first night as a meet n greet...I have asked the Dreams WC to make reservations for us, and she said we would take care of all that when we arrive..I am just nervous they won&#039;t be able to accomodate all us for on such short notice..any thoughts or advice would be appreciated!","Attachments":[],"Id":489078,"PostDate":1224883841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Quick Question - Has anyone thrown a welcome dinner the first night they arrived? We fly in around 1230 on a Sunday afternoon, and I was thinking it would be nice for all of us (approx 35 ppl) to have dinner together the first night as a meet n greet...I have asked the Dreams WC to make reservations for us, and she said we would take care of all that when we arrive..I am just nervous they won't be able to accomodate all us for on such short notice..any thoughts or advice would be appreciated!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickercentral.com\/view\/9ybg\/1.png\">http:\/\/www.tickercentral.com\/view\/9ybg\/1.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bechll@snc.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1217230789,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210816.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrslbs","Id":210816,"Name":"mrslbs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9130f05bcfc2325a4233c735b9a31ff","RawContent":"I wouldn&#039;t worry about there not being enough room. At worst you could hold your welcome dinner in the main buffet. Chances are you will be able to find one of the restaurants that can accommodate you at some point in the evening. \n \n We are doing a welcome brunch the morning following our arrival (we arrive late at night) and I won&#039;t be making any reservations. I will be telling our guests to meet us in the buffet and people can come and go as they like. We have about the same number of guests as yourself. \n \n Have fun!","Attachments":[],"Id":489808,"PostDate":1224957417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wouldn't worry about there not being enough room. At worst you could hold your welcome dinner in the main buffet. Chances are you will be able to find one of the restaurants that can accommodate you at some point in the evening. <br \/> <br \/> We are doing a welcome brunch the morning following our arrival (we arrive late at night) and I won't be making any reservations. I will be telling our guests to meet us in the buffet and people can come and go as they like. We have about the same number of guests as yourself. <br \/> <br \/> Have fun!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelley.brule@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212544320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209743.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chika","Id":209743,"Name":"chika","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11205,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8e5837e85cf2d45bf8cea2fef9ac6b4","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;chika&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I believe Dreams can only have 2 weddings per day as a rule. \n \n I can&#039;t wait to get married there! It is only one week and one month away for me. I will definitely post pics when I get back. As well as a lengthy review. \n \n :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Shelley,\n \n I am at the Dreams Resort right now. \n I shot a wedding here yesterday and resort had 2 other weddings happening at the same day.\n \n It is a beautiful resort and it has a lots of great spots for photography!","Attachments":[],"Id":489897,"PostDate":1224966418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>chika<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I believe Dreams can only have 2 weddings per day as a rule. <br \/> <br \/> I can't wait to get married there! It is only one week and one month away for me. I will definitely post pics when I get back. As well as a lengthy review. <br \/> <br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Shelley,<br \/> <br \/> I am at the Dreams Resort right now. <br \/> I shot a wedding here yesterday and resort had 2 other weddings happening at the same day.<br \/> <br \/> It is a beautiful resort and it has a lots of great spots for photography!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"varyshka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1193085840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207873.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":74,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Varia","Id":207873,"Name":"Varia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4754,"TotalPages":476,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":4750},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
